Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:42:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: OIS of the OnePlus 8 Pro main
 camera

Add the LC898128 OIS driver and enable it, and the device tree node with its supply.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
